<title>ESTONIA: SAKU 4-MO PROFIT.</title>
<headline>SAKU 4-MO PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saku brewery said on Thursday that its net profit in the first four months of the year was 5.3 million kroons compared to 3.6 million kroons in the same period of 1996.</p>
<p>Saku's net sales in the first four months of 1997 were 106.6 million kroons compared to 97.5 million kroons for the same period in 1996, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Total assets in April 1997 were 252.9 million kroons compared to April 1996's 278.3 million kroons.</p>
<p>The brewery's total income for the first four months was 110.1 million kroons, up from 1996's 99.9 million kroons for the same period.</p>
<p>Total business expenses were 103 million kroons compared to 1996's 94.1 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
